                "text": "President Trump's priority during the Republican Shutdown? Demolishing the East Wing to build a ballroom. Meanwhile two million Pennsylvanians will miss their SNAP payments soon. I'm fighting to protect the health and well-being of all Americans. I invite President Trump and my Republican colleagues to do the same.",
