                "text": "I will be hosting my 3rd annual Medicare/healthcare telephone town hall on Monday, October 27th at 10:30 AM. Joining me are members of the Chester County Health Department and the Chester County Department of Aging Services to help any questions you may have on PA MEDI and other programs.\n\nYou can join by phone or by visiting https://t.co/LskfqzZM3k",
