                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "Energy prices are going up \u2013 rising at almost double the rate of inflation. According to Wired, nearly 80 million Americans regularly have to make the impossible choice of paying their utility bills or purchasing groceries and medicine. And utility bill debt totals $17 billion across the U.S.\n \nPrograms like LIHEAP can help with utility bills, but that assistance only goes so far.\n \nWe have to do more to bring costs down and provide relief from rising prices. We should be encouraging home energy efficiency tax credits and rebates, not stripping them away like Republicans did in their budget bill.\n\nhttps://t.co/KKqsKSwZKH",
