                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "On my recent tour of Phoenixville Hospital, I spoke with healthcare professionals who shared concerns about health insurance premiums spiking at the end of this year.  \n\nPhoenixville Hospital is already working to accommodate more patients, and when ACA tax credits expire, the Emergency Department can expect an influx of the newly uninsured.  \n\nIn our community and across the country, ACA tax credits help keep people alive and able to access care. Congress must take this opportunity to extend them before the end of the year.",
